{"src":"audio/Vv7.mp3","label":"東西 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v8","en":"coffee","note":"two level 1sts, k puff","cells":[{"ch":"咖","py":"kā","t":1},{"ch":"啡","py":"fēi","t":1,"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]}],"cues":[{"chip":"ei","lab":"fēi","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv8.mp3","label":"咖啡 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v9","en":"to like","note":"xǐ half-third; Taiwan often full huān","cells":[{"ch":"喜","py":"xǐ","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"]},{"ch":"歡","py":"huān","t":1,"s":"欢"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"xǐ","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv9.mp3","label":"喜歡 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v10","en":"tea","note":"ch = Position 2 + puff","cells":[{"ch":"茶","py":"chá","t":2,"mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv10.mp3","label":"茶 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v11","en":"[possessive]","note":"","cells":[{"ch":"的","py":"de","t":5}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv11.mp3","label":"的 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v12","en":"this","note":"Taiwan also zhèi","cells":[{"ch":"這","py":"zhè","t":4,"s":"这","mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv12.mp3","label":"這 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v13","en":"now","note":"x Position 1 vs z Position 3","cells":[{"ch":"現","py":"xiàn","t":4,"s":"现"},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv13.mp3","label":"現在 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]}]},{"type":"cards","title":"Listening notes","items":[["3+3 rises: 我喜歡, 你喜歡, 我還好 (not).","我喜歡 and 你喜歡 start with a rise: wó xǐ huān, ní xǐ huān, then xǐ creaks low before the level huān. 我還好 has no 3+3 (還 is 2nd): wǒ stays a half-third, hái rises, and 好 at the pause gets the full dip [214]."],["Half-thirds before non-thirds.","你聽, 我聽, 我們, 你在, 我在, 你看, 我的: the 3rd stays a low creak [21] and the next syllable takes off from the floor."],["得 goes neutral in 聽得到.","Vocab lists 得到 dé dào, but as the potential complement it is light: tīng de dào, a high level, a short mid blip, then the 4th falling."],["Tone runs on one pitch level.","咖啡 kā fēi is 55-55, flat and high. 烏龍茶 wū lóng chá is 55-35-35: two rises in a row, the second one a little lower and smaller."],["Position 1, 2, 3 sibilants in a row.","現在在 xiàn zài zài contrasts alveolo-palatal [ɕ] with plain dental [ts]; 這是 zhè shì and 茶 chá are retroflex [ʈʂ ʂ ʈʂʰ]. 說中文 stacks three retroflex-ish onsets (sh, zh)."],["Particles bend to the sound before them.","啊 after 文 -n comes out close to na (說中文啊 → wén na); after 有 it glides into ya. 嗎, 呢, 吧 are light, popping up after a 3rd (你呢) and sitting low after a 4th (聽得到嗎)."],["有 for ‘yes’.","有 yǒu as a stand-alone ‘yes’ is typical Taiwan Mandarin. Alone, it gets the full dip; in 有啊 it is a half-third with 啊 floating up."]]}],"schema":1,"date":"2026-10-31T18:50-04:00"}